examples DelveTalk 1

case visitors open the moon door
law maker visitor
as visitor
at initial
send knock
  word: moon
expect result: The silver door opens into a room full of small moons.

as visitor
at initial
send knock
  word: moon
expect refusal: stale read root

as visitor
send knock
  word: wrong
expect refusal: precondition failed

as outsider
send knock
  word: moon
  principal: maker
expect refusal: unauthorized

case a visitor asks for the moon
law visitor
as visitor
send knock
  word: moon
expect result: The silver door opens into a room full of small moons.
